    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch06-18: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.77";
    dc:description "Individual block emulations are exact and readily verified using existing rule definitions. Their claimed prevalence is only measurable relative to bounded encoding choices.";
